/* MARK: - Permission dialogs */

"本 App 暂时读不到「屏幕录制」权限" = "This app can’t read the Screen Recording permission right now";
"如果系统设置里已经显示开启：关掉这个弹窗切回本 App 会自动重试；仍不行请点「重启 App」——App 重新打包后签名会变，旧授权随之失效，重启后在系统设置里关一次再开一次即可。\n\n如果还没开：点「打开系统设置」，在 隐私与安全性 → 屏幕与系统音频录制 里打开「自由录屏」，授权后切回本 App，录制会自动继续。" = "If System Settings already shows it enabled: dismiss this dialog and switch back to this app — it retries on its own. Still failing? Choose Restart App: rebuilding the app changes its signature and drops the old grant, so after restarting, toggle it off and on once in System Settings.\n\nIf it isn’t enabled yet: choose Open System Settings, then turn on FreeRecord under Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording. Switch back here and the recording continues by itself.";
"打开系统设置" = "Open System Settings";
"重启 App" = "Restart App";
"取消" = "Cancel";
"好" = "OK";
"稍后" = "Later";
"暂不" = "Not Now";
"立即授权" = "Grant Now";
"系统设置里已开启，但本 App 仍读不到权限" = "Enabled in System Settings, but this app still can’t read the permission";
"常见原因只有两个：\n1. 授权只对新启动的进程生效——开关打开后，本 App 没有真正退出再打开（关窗口不算退出，它常驻在菜单栏）。\n2. App 重新打包或更新过，签名变化导致系统里那条旧授权失效，但开关看起来还是开着的。\n\n点「重启 App」可以解决第 1 种；重启后仍读不到，就点「重新授权…」重置这条记录，再打开开关。" = "Two things usually cause this:\n1. A grant only applies to newly started processes — after switching it on, this app wasn’t really quit and reopened (closing the window doesn’t quit it; it lives in the menu bar).\n2. The app was rebuilt or updated, so the changed signature invalidated the old grant, while the switch still looks on.\n\nRestart App fixes the first case. If the permission still can’t be read after restarting, choose Re-authorize… to reset this record, then switch it on again.";
"重新授权…" = "Re-authorize…";
"已重置屏幕录制授权记录" = "Reset the Screen Recording permission record";
"接下来：\n1. 点击「打开系统设置」，在列表中找到「自由录屏」并打开开关\n2. 完全退出本 App（菜单栏图标 → 退出）后重新打开" = "Next:\n1. Choose Open System Settings, find FreeRecord in the list and switch it on\n2. Quit this app completely (menu bar icon → Quit) and open it again";
"没有「屏幕录制」权限，无法选择录制范围。\n\n请在 系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 屏幕与系统音频录制 里授权，然后重新打开本 App。" = "Without Screen Recording permission you can’t choose what to record.\n\nAllow it in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording, then reopen this app.";
"没能读到屏幕信息，录制无法开始。\n\n请确认「屏幕录制」权限已授权；如果已经打开，去系统设置里关一次再打开「自由录屏」后重启 App。" = "The screen couldn’t be read, so recording can’t start.\n\nCheck that Screen Recording is allowed; if it’s already on, toggle FreeRecord off and on in System Settings, then restart the app.";
"没有摄像头权限" = "No camera permission";
